1. Scope and definitions

"Software" means the original MySearchWidget code and documentation made
available under this license, including modifications to that code and
works derived from it. Third-party components and assets identified as
subject to separate terms are excluded and retain their own licenses.

"Non-Commercial" means not intended for or directed toward commercial
advantage or monetary compensation. Commercial use includes selling or
licensing the Software for payment, monetizing it through advertising,
providing it as part of a paid service, and using or incorporating it in
commercial products, services, or business operations. Personal use,
non-commercial education, and non-commercial research are permitted.

"Corresponding Source" means the complete preferred form for modifying
the exact version distributed, including all modifications, source files,
interface definitions, dependency manifests and version information,
build scripts, and instructions needed to build and install that version.
Obfuscated code, decompiled output, or patches alone are not sufficient.
Unmodified general-purpose build tools and standard system libraries do
not have to be bundled, but required tools and dependencies must be
identified with instructions for obtaining them. Private signing keys,
credentials, and personal data are not required.

